* SPICE Netlist
Vsig 7 0 DC Vsig_value ; Replace Vsig_value with actual voltage value
Rsig 7 2 Rsig_value ; Replace Rsig_value with actual resistance value
RC 5 3 RC_value ; Replace RC_value with actual resistance value
Q1 5 2 0 NPN ; NPN Transistor with collector (5), base (2), emitter (0)
